===Etymology===
From the title character, Dolores "{{m|en|Lolita}}" Haze, of [[w:Vladimir Nabokov|Vladimir Nabokov's]] 1955 novel [[w:Lolita|''Lolita'']].

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A young girl who is thought (usually by an [[adult]] [[male]]) to be sexually [[alluring]].

